    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like \"existence\" though. it feels like i'm just stuck in this waiting room. everything just feels so empty. i keep thinking that if we were really one person, then part of me is already gone. it's like i'm just a fragment waiting to be whole again. doesn't that make sense?",
